# Commands that need authentication must be rejected before login, no
# matter which state they really want. A few per connection: the server
# slows down a client that collects errors, so a long run of these on
# one connection would take minutes. The connections overlap instead.
protocol imap c1
send 3
a select inbox
b status inbox (messages)
c fetch 1:* (uid flags)
protocol imap c2
send 3
a create /ernest/mja
b getacl inbox
c uid search all
protocol imap c3
send 3
a list "" %
b getquotaroot inbox
c sort (date) utf-8 all
protocol imap c4
send 3
a lsub "" %
b myrights inbox
c store 1 +flags \seen
use c1
receive 4
* OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 AUTH=ANONYMOUS AUTH=CRAM-MD5 AUTH=DIGEST-MD5 AUTH=PLAIN AUTH=LOGIN COMPRESS=DEFLATE ENABLE ID SASL-IR STARTTLS] imapscript.test.oryx.com Archiveopteryx IMAP Server (security checking disabled)
a BAD Not permitted before authentication
b BAD Not permitted before authentication
c BAD Not permitted before authentication
use c2
receive 4
* OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 AUTH=ANONYMOUS AUTH=CRAM-MD5 AUTH=DIGEST-MD5 AUTH=PLAIN AUTH=LOGIN COMPRESS=DEFLATE ENABLE ID SASL-IR STARTTLS] imapscript.test.oryx.com Archiveopteryx IMAP Server (security checking disabled)
a BAD Not permitted before authentication
b BAD Not permitted before authentication
c BAD Not permitted before authentication
use c3
receive 4
* OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 AUTH=ANONYMOUS AUTH=CRAM-MD5 AUTH=DIGEST-MD5 AUTH=PLAIN AUTH=LOGIN COMPRESS=DEFLATE ENABLE ID SASL-IR STARTTLS] imapscript.test.oryx.com Archiveopteryx IMAP Server (security checking disabled)
a BAD Not permitted before authentication
b BAD Not permitted before authentication
c BAD Not permitted before authentication
use c4
receive 4
* OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 AUTH=ANONYMOUS AUTH=CRAM-MD5 AUTH=DIGEST-MD5 AUTH=PLAIN AUTH=LOGIN COMPRESS=DEFLATE ENABLE ID SASL-IR STARTTLS] imapscript.test.oryx.com Archiveopteryx IMAP Server (security checking disabled)
a BAD Not permitted before authentication
b BAD Not permitted before authentication
c BAD Not permitted before authentication
end
